---
title: "Team members"
description: "Current members, former students, and collaborators of the Hogle Lab at the University of Turku."
---
{#
    Rendered from src/_data/team.json. Members with a non-empty "links" array
    get the two-column layout (biography beside a Connect list); members without
    links get the full-width single-column layout.
#}
<section class="section">
    <div class="container is-max-widescreen">
        <div class="column">
            <p class="is-size-3 has-text-weight-bold mb-4">Current members</p>
            <p class="is-size-6 mb-4">Our team is comprised doctoral researchers, masters students, and advanced bachelor students. <a href="/join">Interested in joining?</a></p>

            {% for member in team.current %}
            <hr>
            <div class="block">
                <div class="columns">
                    <div class="column is-one-fifth">
                        <figure class="image is-square">
                            <img class="is-rounded" src="{{ member.image }}" alt="{{ member.alt }}">
                        </figure>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column is-four-fifths">
                        <p class="is-size-4 mb-4"><b>{{ member.name }}</b>{% if member.pronouns %} ({{ member.pronouns }}){% endif %}; {{ member.role }}</p>
                        {% if member.links | length %}
                        <div class="columns">
                            <div class="column is-two-thirds">
                                {% for para in member.bio %}
                                <p class="is-size-6 {{ 'mt-4' if loop.first else 'mt-3' }}">{{ para | safe }}</p>
                                {% endfor %}
                                <p class="is-size-6 mt-3"><b>Background:</b></p>
                                <ul>
                                    {% for item in member.background %}
                                    <li> &#8226; {{ item | safe }}</li>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="column is-one-third">
                                <p class="is-size-6 mt-3"><b>Connect:</b></p>
                                <ul>
                                    {% for link in member.links %}
                                    <li><span class="icon-text"><span class="icon"><i class="{{ link.icon }}"></i></span><span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }}</a></span></span></li>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        {% else %}
                        {% for para in member.bio %}
                        <p class="is-size-6 {{ '' if loop.first else 'mt-4' }}">{{ para | safe }}</p>
                        {% endfor %}
                        <p class="is-size-6 mt-3"><b>Background:</b></p>
                        <ul>
                            {% for item in member.background %}
                            <li> &#8226; {{ item | safe }}</li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}

            <hr>
            <p class="is-size-3 has-text-weight-bold mb-4">Former members</p>
            {% for group in team.former %}
            <p class="is-size-5 has-text-weight-bold mb-4">{{ group.heading }}</p>
            <div class="content">
                <ul>
                    {% for person in group.people %}
                    <li>{{ person | safe }}</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}

            <hr>
            <p class="is-size-3 has-text-weight-bold mb-4">Collaborators</p>
            <p class="is-size-6 mb-4">Here are some great people with whom we have ongoing collaborations!</p>
            <div class="content">
                <ul>
                    {% for person in team.collaborators %}
                    <li>{{ person | safe }}</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
